1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:04,200
Anyways, first up I got these red corduroy pants.
总之，先来看我买的这条红色灯芯绒裤子。

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:09,239
When I saw these on the rack, I did not think I was gonna like them that much because the color is so bright.
在衣架上看到它时，我本来没觉得自己会多喜欢，因为颜色太鲜艳了。

3
00:00:09,239 --> 00:00:14,840
It's like a very in your face Clifford red red. It's a red red, you know.
就是那种特别抢眼的大红色，真的很红，你懂吧。

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,640
And normally I'm more of like a neutral tones type of gal.
而我平时更偏爱中性色。

5
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:21,640
But I tried these on in the fitting room, and they just fit so well.
但在试衣间试穿之后，我发现它特别合身。

6
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:27,080
I have a weirdly long torso for some reason. I know, she got torso for days, boys.
不知道为什么，我的上半身特别长，真的长到可以拿来开玩笑。

7
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:33,959
I have like really short legs and a long torso, so sometimes it can be really hard for me to find pants that fit well, especially high waisted pants.
我的腿相对短、上半身长，所以有时很难买到合身的裤子，尤其是高腰裤。

8
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:40,280
Because pants that are high waisted on like a normal torso are not that high waisted on my lengthy ass torso.
因为在一般身形上算高腰的裤子，到了我这个特别长的上半身上，就没那么高腰了。

9
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:43,320
So these ones hit me right at my natural waist, which is perfect.
所以，这条裤子的裤腰刚好落在我自然腰线的位置，非常合适。

10
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:50,440
And honestly, like, when I tried them on in the fitting room, there is something about having bright red pants on that makes you feel kind of like confident and groovy.
说真的，在试衣间穿上它时，鲜红的裤子就是会让人觉得自信又有范儿。

11
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,229
So I liked it.
所以我就喜欢上它了。

12
00:00:51,239 --> 00:00:58,200
I thought it especially paired well with a graphic T shirt like this one that has a little bit of red detail on it, so it ties the whole outfit together.
我觉得它特别适合搭配这种带一点红色图案的 T 恤，能把整套穿搭呼应起来。

13
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:03,160
Oh, and these were only seven pounds, which is actually pretty comparable to American thrift stores.
而且它只要七英镑，和美国旧衣店的价格其实差不多。

14
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,440
Um, so I was quite proud of these.
所以，这条裤子算是让我挺得意的一次收获。

15
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:09,640
The other thing I got from Trade was this dress. Oh my goodness.
在 Trade 买的另一件，是这条连衣裙，天哪。

16
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:14,440
Um, again, this was something I picked up off the rack, and I was like, this is a little bit much. This is a little bit silly.
这件也是我从衣架上拿下来的，当时还在想：会不会有点太夸张了，有点好笑。

17
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:17,000
But once I tried it on, I don't know, I just really liked it.
但一试上身，我也说不上来，就是很喜欢。

18
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:25,630
I don't know what occasion a normal person would wear this to, maybe like a wedding or a casting call for Alice in Wonderland.
我都不知道平时能在什么场合穿它，也许是婚礼，或者《爱丽丝梦游仙境》的试镜吧。

19
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:36,590
But I guess one really nice perk of my job is, even if I don't get to wear this like every single day as a normal person, I at least will get to wear it for like a look book or a photo shoot or an event.
不过，我这份工作有个好处：就算日常穿不到，至少还能在穿搭展示、拍摄或活动上穿它。

20
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,070
I could wear this to the Streamies, maybe.
也许还可以穿着去参加 Streamys 颁奖活动。

21
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:42,200
I kind of wish that we could just wear whatever we wanted to.
我有点希望大家都能想穿什么就穿什么。

22
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:46,119
Like, I know you can kind of wear whatever you want to, but like really wear whatever you want to.
我知道某种程度上本来就能自由穿衣，但我是说，真正彻底地想穿什么就穿什么。

23
00:01:46,119 --> 00:01:50,200
Like if you felt like wearing a scuba diving outfit one day, you could wear that.
比如，哪天想穿潜水服，就穿潜水服。

24
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:54,519
Or if you felt like dressing up like a little tea time princess, you could do that.
或者想打扮成喝下午茶的小公主，也可以。

25
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:59,229
Or if you wanted to dress up like an 18th century monarch to go to the grocery store, you could also do that.
甚至想打扮成十八世纪的君主去买菜，也都可以。

26
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:05,640
Now onto stuff that I got from Goldsmith Vintage. I caved, and I bought this denim jacket.
接着看我在 Goldsmith Vintage 买的东西。我没忍住，买下了这件牛仔外套。

27
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:13,480
I also know that somebody is going to make fun of me for buying this denim jacket because I just did a closet clear out video like a month ago, and I got rid of a couple denim jackets.
我也知道，会有人笑我又买牛仔外套，因为大约一个月前我才拍过清衣柜的视频，还处理掉了几件牛仔外套。

28
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:18,360
And my defense for that is that, um, you are right, and I'm awful.
对此我的辩解就是：嗯，你们说得对，是我不争气。

29
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:24,920
But I do really love the fit of this denim jacket, and it is something that I had actually specifically been looking for.
但我真的很喜欢这件牛仔外套的版型，而且这正是我一直特意在找的。

30
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:33,239
A lot of my previous denim jackets and denim jackets that you'll normally find at new, um, what's a new clothing store called? Just a regular clothing store.
我之前的很多牛仔外套，还有那些在卖新衣服的……嗯，怎么说，就是普通服装店里常见的外套。

31
00:02:33,239 --> 00:02:41,560
A lot of the times, the silhouette that you'll find at contemporary retailers is oversized, but then it'll cinch back in at the bottom.
很多现代零售店里的外套轮廓是宽大的，但下摆又会收进去。

32
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:51,480
And I find that really unflattering, especially if you're wearing a dress or skirt that flares out, because it like prevents your silhouette from flaring out, and you really tend to lose your waistline.
我觉得这样不太衬人，尤其搭配向外展开的裙子时，下摆会限制裙子的轮廓，还容易把腰线藏起来。

33
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:57,399
Versus vintage denim jackets tend to flare out at the bottom, so it's a little bit more of a triangular shape.
相比之下，复古牛仔外套的下摆往往会向外展开，整体更接近三角形。

34
00:02:57,399 --> 00:03:01,399
I kind of look like a little denim nacho chip, if you know what I mean.
你要是懂我的意思的话，我看着有点像一片牛仔布玉米片。

35
00:03:01,399 --> 00:03:09,560
But when I'm pairing it with dresses and skirts, I think it's a lot more flattering because it allows my hips to kind of flare out, if that makes sense at all.
但搭配连衣裙或半身裙时，我觉得这样更衬我，因为能让裙子在臀部自然向外展开。希望这么说能讲明白。

36
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:18,030
It also has this quilted lining, which I really like, rolling up the sleeves and having that little pop of yellow to contrast with the blue denim.
它还有我很喜欢的绗缝内衬，把袖子卷起来，就能露出一小块黄色，和蓝色牛仔布形成对比。

37
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:25,480
Moral of the story is that I am a huge nerd for denim jacket fits and very small details, and this is by far my favorite denim jacket that I have owned so far.
总之，我就是个对牛仔外套版型和小细节很较真的人，这也是我目前拥有过的外套里最喜欢的一件。

38
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,880
So that was why I was willing to splurge on it a little bit.
所以，我才愿意为它稍微多花一点钱。
